#: kcountrypage.cpp:55
msgid "<h3>Welcome to KDE %1!</h3>"
msgstr "<h3>Dobro došli u KDE %1!</h3>"

#: findlanguage.cpp:58 kcountrypage.cpp:184 kcountrypage.cpp:200
#: kcountrypage.cpp:261
msgid "without name"
msgstr "bez imena"

#: kcountrypage.cpp:255
msgid "Other"
msgstr "Ostalo"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Form1"
msgstr "Form1"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "Please choose your language:"
msgstr "Molim izaberite svoj jezik:"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<P> This Personalizer will help you configure the basic setup of your KDE "
"desktop in five quick, easy steps. You can set things like your country (for "
"date and time formats, etc.), language, desktop behavior and more. </P> \n"
"<P> You will be able to change all the settings later using the KDE Control "
"Center. You may choose to postpone your personalization until later by "
"clicking on Skip. However, new users are encouraged to use this simple "
"method. </P>\n"
"<P> If you already like your KDE configuration and wish to quit the "
"Personalizer, press Skip Wizard, then Quit and Keep. </P>"
msgstr ""
"<P> Ovaj Personalizator će vam pomoći da podesite osnovne postavke vaše "
"KDE radne površine u pet brzih, jednostavnih koraka. Ovdje možete podesiti "
"stvari kao što je vaša zemlja (za oblik datuma i vremena itd.), vaš "
"jezik, ponašanje radne površine i više. </P> \n"
"<P> Kasnije ćete moći izmjeniti sve postavke koristeći KDE Kontrolni "
"centar. Možete izabrati da odgodite vašu personalizaciju za kasnije, tako "
"što ćete kliknuti na dugme Preskoči. Ipak, ohrabrujemo nove korisnike da "
"upotrijebe ovaj jednostavan metod. </P>\n"
"<P> Ako vam se dopada kako je sada postavljen KDE i želite da napustite "
"Personalizator, pritisnite dugme Preskoči čarobnjak, zatim na Izlaz i "
"Sačuvaj. </P>"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid "<h3>Welcome to KDE %VERSION%!</h3>"
msgstr "<h3>Dobro došli u KDE %VERSION%!</h3>"

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "Please choose your country:"
msgstr "Molim izaberite vašu državu:"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "&Enlarge fonts"
msgstr "&Povećaj fontove"

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "This allowes visually impaired people to use the personalizer"
msgstr "Ovo omogućuje ljudima sa vizuelnim nedostacima da koriste personalizator"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "Form3"
msgstr "Form3"

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"<P>KDE offers many visually appealing special effects, such as smoothed "
"fonts, previews in the file manager and animated menus. All this beauty, "
"however, comes at a small performance cost. </P>\n"
"If you have a fast, new processor, you might want to turn them all on, but "
"for those of us with slower processors, starting off with less eye candy "
"helps to keep your desktop more responsive."
msgstr ""
"<P>KDE pruža razne privlačne posebne efekte, kao što su zaobljeni "
"fontovi, pregledi u datotečnom menadžeru i animirani meniji. Sva ova "
"ljepota, ipak, dolazi po cijeni malog gubitka performansi. </P>\n"
"Ako imate brz, novi procesor, možda ih možete sve uključiti, ali za one "
"sa slabijim procesorima, početak sa manje ukrasa za oči može pomoći da "
"radni prostor reaguje malo brže."

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid ""
"Slow Processor\n"
"(fewer effects)"
msgstr ""
"Spor procesor\n"
"(manje efekata)"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "Fast processors can support all effects"
msgstr "Brži procesori mogu podržati sve efekte"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid ""
"Fast Processor\n"
"(more effects)"
msgstr ""
"Brz procesor\n"
"(više efekata)"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "Slow processors perform poorly with effects"
msgstr "Spori procesori daju slabe performanse uz uključene efekte"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "Show &Details >>"
msgstr "Prikaži &detalje >>"

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Form2"
msgstr "Form2"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Description:"
msgstr "Opis:"

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "Please select your preferred system behavior:"
msgstr "Molim izaberite željeno ponašanje sistema:"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "KDE (TM)"
msgstr "KDE (TM)"

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "UNIX (R)"
msgstr "UNIX (R)"

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid "Microsoft Windows (R)"
msgstr "Microsoft Windows (R)"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Apple MacOS (R)"
msgstr "Apple MacOS (R)"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid ""
"<b>System Behavior</b><br>\n"
"Graphical User Interfaces behave differently on various Operating Systems. \n"
"KDE allows you to customize its behavior according to your needs."
msgstr ""
"<b>Ponašanje sistema</b><br>\n"
"Grafičko korisničko okruženje se ponaša različito na raznim operativnim "
"sistemima. \n"
"KDE vam omogućuje da prilagodite ovo ponašanje vašim navikama i potrebama."

#: rc.cpp:23
msgid "Form5"
msgstr "Form5"

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid ""
"<h3>Finished</H3> After closing this dialog you can always restart this "
"Wizard by choosing the entry \"Desktop Settings Wizard\" from the System "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"<h3>Završeno</H3> Nakon zatvaranja ovog dijaloga uvijek možete ponovo "
"pokrenuti ovaj čarobnjak birajući stavku \"Čarobnjak za postavke radne "
"površine\" na sistemskom meniju."

#: rc.cpp:25
msgid ""
"You can refine the settings you made by starting the KDE Control Center by "
"choosing the entry \"Control Center\" in the main KDE menu."
msgstr ""
"Možete rafinirati vaše postavke pomoću KDE Kontrolnog centra koje možete "
"pokrenuti birajući \"Kontrolni centar\" na glavnom KDE meniju."

#: rc.cpp:26
msgid "You can also start the KDE Control Center using the button below."
msgstr "Također možete pokrenuti KDE Kontrolni centar koristeći dugme ispod."

#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "&Launch KDE Control Center"
msgstr "&Pokreni KDE Kontrolni centar"

#: rc.cpp:28
msgid "Form4"
msgstr "Form4"

#: rc.cpp:29
msgid ""
"Please choose the way your computer should look by selecting one of the "
"items below."
msgstr ""
"Molim izaberite kako će izgledati vaš računar birajući jednu od stavki "
"ispod."

